#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:15
msgid "Custom options in ``platformio.ini``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:17
msgid ""
"PlatformIO allows you extending project configuration with own data. Custom "
"options have to start with ``custom_`` or ``board_`` to not generate a "
"warning that the unknown configuration option will be ignored by PlatformIO. "
"You can read these values later using `ProjectConfig API <https://github.com/"
"platformio/platformio-core/blob/develop/platformio/project/config.py>`__:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:0
msgid "``ProjectConfig::get(section, option, default=None)``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:23
msgid "Get an option value for the named section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:0
msgid "``ProjectConfig::options(section)``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:26
msgid "Returns a list of the sections available"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:0
msgid "``ProjectConfig::items(section, as_dict=False)``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:29
msgid ""
"Returns a list of \"name\", \"value\" pairs for the options in the given "
"section or a dictionary when ``as_dict=True`` is passed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:0
msgid "``ProjectConfig::has_section(section)``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:32
msgid "Indicates whether the named section is present in the configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:0
msgid "``ProjectConfig::has_option(section, option)``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:35
msgid ""
"If the given section exists, and contains the given option, returns "
"``True``; otherwise returns ``False``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../scripting/examples/platformio_ini_custom_options.rst:37
msgid ""
"PlatformIO's \"ProjectConfig\" is compatible with a native Python's "
"`ConfigParser <https://docs.python.org/3/library/configparser.html>`__ API."
msgstr ""

